      "method": "Built-in ImageGen",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: LifeSync productivity app login hero, vertical 2:3 image. Create an exquisite 3D studio still life: a large sculptural brushed titanium circular analog clock, tilted slightly in perspective, floating above an elliptical running track, accompanied by a small ivory calendar tile and a sculptural metallic dumbbell. Schedule, time, sport. Deep midnight navy background, cyan edge lights, pearlescent silver materials, sophisticated physically based rendering, soft cinematic shadows. Objects grouped in center with plenty of dark negative space around edges, no text, no letters, no logos, no watermarks. Clear readable silhouettes, not a busy sci-fi scene. Save image for use as website asset."
    }
